[{"_1":2},"routes/post",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8,"_9":-5,"_10":-5,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"post",{"_31":45,"_33":46,"_68":89,"_90":91,"_60":61,"_92":93},"chars",778,"updated","thumbnail","excerpt","조건식이 참이면 코드 블럭을 실행하고, 거짓이면 while문을 벗어난다. 코드 블록 실행이 끝나면 다시 조건식 검사로 돌아가서 조건식을 검사한다. (무한 반복) while 문과 비슷하지만, 조건에 관계 없이 무조건…","html","<h2 id=\"반복문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#반복문\">반복문</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"while-문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#while-문\">while 문</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (조건식) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>조건식이 참이면 코드 블럭을 실행하고, 거짓이면 while문을 벗어난다.\n<ul>\n<li>코드 블록 실행이 끝나면 다시 조건식 검사로 돌아가서 조건식을 검사한다. (무한 반복)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"do-while-문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#do-while-문\">do-while 문</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 실행할 코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (조건식)</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>while</span></span></code></span> 문과 비슷하지만, 조건에 관계 없이 무조건 한 번은 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>do</span></span></code></span> 블록 안의 코드를 실행한다.</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>do</span></span></code></span> 블록의 코드를 실행한 뒤, 조건식을 검증한다.\n<ul>\n<li>참이면 다시 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>do</span></span></code></span> 블록의 코드를 실행한다.</li>\n<li>거짓이라면 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>do-while</span></span></code></span> 문을 빠져나온다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"break-continue\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#break-continue\">break, continue</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>반복문에서 사용하는 키워드</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>break</span></span></code></span></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(조건식) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    코드1;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    break</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 코드2를 실행하지 않고 즉시 while문 종료로 이동</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    코드2;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}    </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// while문 종료</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>반복문을 즉시 종료 후 탈출한다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>continue</span></span></code></span></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(조건식) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    코드1;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    continue</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 코드2를 실행하지 않고 즉시 조건식으로 이동</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    코드2;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>반복문 내부의 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>continue</span></span></code></span> 키워드 이후 부분을 건너 뛰고 다음 반복을 진행한다.</li>\n<li>while문의 경우 다시 조건식을 판별한 뒤 참이면 블록을 실행하고 거짓이라면 반복문을 탈출한다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"for-문\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#for-문\">for 문</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><code data-language=\"java\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (1.초기식; 2.조건식; 4.증감식) {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 3.코드</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h4 id=\"실행-순서\"><a class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to heading\" href=\"#실행-순서\">실행 순서</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>초기식 실행, 초기식은 for문 진입 가장 처음에만 1번 실행된다.</li>\n<li>조건식 검증, 참인경우 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>3.코드</span></span></code></span>를 실행하고, 거짓인 경우 for문을 탈출한다.</li>\n<li>코드를 실행한다.</li>\n<li>증감식을 실행한다.</li>\n<li>다시 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"plaintext\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>2.조건식</span></span></code></span>을 검증한다. 이후 반복</li>\n</ol>","headings",[72,73,74,75,76],"related",[65,66,67],"localGraph",{"_49":50,"_51":52},"index",[23,24,25,26,27,28,29,30],{"_31":47,"_33":48},{"_31":45,"_33":46},{"_31":43,"_33":44},{"_31":41,"_33":42},{"_31":39,"_33":40},{"_31":37,"_33":38},{"_31":35,"_33":36},{"_31":32,"_33":34},"slug","serialization-deserialization","title","직렬화(Serialization)/역직렬화(Deserialization)","WWDC25-Whats-new-in-widgets","[WWDC25] What's new in widgets","java-first-step","김영한의 자바 입문 - 코드로 시작하는 자바 첫걸음","java-first-step-variable","김영한의 자바 입문 - 변수","java-first-step-operator","김영한의 자바 입문 - 연산자","java-first-step-conditionals","김영한의 자바 입문 - 조건문","java-first-step-loop-statement","김영한의 자바 입문 - 반복문","java-first-step-scope-casting","김영한의 자바 입문 - 스코프, 형변환","nodes",[56,57],"links",[53],{"_54":45,"_55":37},"source","target",{"_58":45,"_59":46,"_60":61,"_62":64},{"_58":37,"_59":38,"_60":61,"_62":63},"id","name","category","java","val",6,2,{"_31":37,"_33":38,"_68":71},{"_31":43,"_33":44,"_68":70},{"_31":41,"_33":42,"_68":69},"date","2026-11-06","2026-11-07","2026-11-03",{"_58":88,"_78":88,"_80":64},{"_58":86,"_78":87,"_80":81},{"_58":84,"_78":85,"_80":81},{"_58":82,"_78":83,"_80":81},{"_58":77,"_78":79,"_80":81},"for-문","text","for 문","level",3,"break-continue","break, continue","do-while-문","do-while 문","while-문","while 문","반복문","2026-11-08","description","","readingTime",1]
